# Sprinting is land only (docs/design/sprinting.md Phase B, section 4). It ends
# when the player boards the raft and cannot start on the deck or at the helm.
# The islet is across open water from the deck, so boarding is a `stand deck`.

case a sprint from the islet ends on boarding the deck
start walk raft
click
lock
stand planter
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = true
stand deck
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = false

case a double-tap on the deck does not start a sprint
start walk raft
click
lock
stand deck
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x4
expect sprinting = false

case a double-tap at the helm does not start a sprint
start walk raft
click
lock
stand helm
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x4
expect sprinting = false

case sprinting on the islet still works
start walk raft
click
lock
stand planter
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = true

case sprinting on the runway still works
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x4
expect sprinting = true
